1
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:09,300
YAMU! YAMU!

2
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:12,137
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

3
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:13,300
YAMU!

4
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,480
Y 'all move!

5
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:05,180
Why did Kaiba give me his
Fiend Sanctuary Magic card?

6
00:01:05,380 --> 00:01:07,357
He said it was something I'll need.

7
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,800
But can I trust him?

8
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:10,180
Use it wisely.

9
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:12,677
What is the meaning of this, Kaiba?

10
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:14,600
That's for you to figure out.

11
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:19,980
That Magic card is Yugi's only chance
of defeating Marek's Egyptian god card,

12
00:01:20,260 --> 00:01:21,720
the Winged Dragon of Ra.

13
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:25,980
But even if Yugi does
figure out how to use it,

14
00:01:26,240 --> 00:01:29,122
his chances of winning
this duel are pretty slim.

15
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:32,280
Rai is a card like no other,

16
00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:35,717
and although Yu-Gi holds two
Egyptian God cards himself,

17
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:38,682
they pale in comparison
to Marek's Winged Dragon.

18
00:01:40,140 --> 00:01:42,940
Yu-Gi, if you want to win this duel,

19
00:01:43,220 --> 00:01:47,980
you'll use that card instead of counting
on the support of your little fan club.

20
00:01:48,340 --> 00:01:49,540
What does that mean?

21
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:52,757
Doesn't he get that we're
all fighting the same enemy?

22
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:54,600
He did give Yu-Gi that card.

23
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:56,077
Yeah, but I don't trust him.

24
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:59,437
If I were you, I'd toss that
card right off the tower, Yuke.

25
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:04,180
Look, Yu-Gi, no one said you had to use
the card, so feel free to give it back.

26
00:02:05,340 --> 00:02:06,170
No!

27
00:02:06,253 --> 00:02:07,629
What are you doing, Yu-Gi?

28
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:14,180
Kaiba, we may not always
agree, but I still trust you.

29
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:18,150
Attention!

30
00:02:18,233 --> 00:02:19,624
The last duel's about to begin.

31
00:02:20,140 --> 00:02:21,977
Duelists, prepare your cards.

32
00:02:22,060 --> 00:02:27,300
Marek Ishtar will face Yu-Gi-Moto And the
winner will receive the Battle City Crown

33
00:02:28,700 --> 00:02:29,530
Pharaoh,

34
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:32,677
I have been waiting for
this moment for my entire

35
00:02:32,760 --> 00:02:37,260
life Soon your infinite
power will be mine Marek,

36
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:42,040
not only will I defeat you I'll free
you from the darkness that controls you

37
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:49,500
Now that I'd like to see, so come and get
me He's gross Take him down, Yu-Gi Yeah,

38
00:02:49,700 --> 00:02:53,480
it's all you, man I know that
Yu-Gi has two Egyptian God cards,

39
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:54,977
and Marek only has one.

40
00:02:55,060 --> 00:02:57,877
But Yu-Gi's are gonna be
tougher to summon to the field.

41
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,140
And why's that?

42
00:02:59,540 --> 00:03:02,097
Because in order to
summon Obelisk and Slifer,

43
00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:05,200
Yu-Gi's gotta sacrifice
a total of six monsters.

44
00:03:05,620 --> 00:03:10,160
But Marek has a way of summoning the
Winged Dragon of Ra with just one card,

45
00:03:10,340 --> 00:03:11,170
remember?

46
00:03:11,253 --> 00:03:14,460
I activate the magic card, Monster Reborn!

47
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,660
To bring back Ra!

48
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:23,680
Ra, show yourself, my
great beast of the sky!

49
00:03:26,380 --> 00:03:29,400
Prepare to witness its true form!

50
00:03:31,780 --> 00:03:37,140
The winged dragon of Ra has
transformed into Egyptian god Phoenix!

51
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:43,700
Now my beast can instantly destroy
every monster on your side of the field!

52
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:54,377
Marek's Egyptian God card has
so many special abilities,

53
00:03:54,460 --> 00:03:56,057
it's almost impossible to beat.

54
00:03:56,140 --> 00:03:57,081
That's not good.

55
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,060
Wait a sec.

56
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:02,257
Kaiba said that his fancy computer figured

57
00:04:02,340 --> 00:04:04,657
out all the secrets of
the winged dragon of Ra.

58
00:04:04,740 --> 00:04:08,800
So maybe the card Kaiba gave to
Yugi can help him defeat Marek.

59
00:04:09,220 --> 00:04:12,396
Zoolists, please cut and
shuffle your opponent's deck.

60
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:18,957
Yes, shuffle well, Pharaoh.

61
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:23,160
and hope with all of your soul
that Ra ends up on the bottom.

62
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:25,540
Thank you, man. For what?

63
00:04:25,780 --> 00:04:29,257
Just because I gave Yugi a good
card doesn't mean he'll win.

64
00:04:29,340 --> 00:04:32,797
He'll have to figure out how
to use it, and even if he does,

65
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:34,468
he'll probably lose anyway.

66
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:38,409
Maybe then you'll stop believing
that fairy tales come true.

67
00:04:38,660 --> 00:04:42,680
Yugi's no Pharaoh Ishizu, and he's
not destined to save the world,

68
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:45,180
so wake up and stop living in the past.

69
00:04:45,500 --> 00:04:50,440
I realized a long time ago that the
only way to succeed is to look ahead.

70
00:04:50,740 --> 00:04:52,000
That is not true.

71
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,440
Just watch.

72
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:58,380
I assure you that before this duel
is over, you will believe me, Kaiba.

73
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,800
Mark my words.

74
00:05:00,100 --> 00:05:03,297
Yugi thinks I gave him that
card as an act of friendship.

75
00:05:03,380 --> 00:05:04,620
That's ridiculous.

76
00:05:05,220 --> 00:05:06,808
Friendship is for the weak.

77
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:10,040
Here's your deck, Barrow.

78
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,360
Now it's time.

79
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:14,380
Time for the shadows to consume your soul.

80
00:05:16,380 --> 00:05:18,800
Eric, destiny's on my side today.

81
00:05:19,580 --> 00:05:21,940
The whole world is counting on me.

82
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:26,337
Your foolish confidence
shows me that you have no

83
00:05:26,420 --> 00:05:30,067
comprehension of the true horror
that awaits you in this duel.

84
00:05:31,460 --> 00:05:33,220
Yugi, don't listen to him.

85
00:05:33,340 --> 00:05:36,017
Yeah, he's just trying
to psych you out, Yugi.

86
00:05:36,100 --> 00:05:40,160
Wipe the floor with him and make
him pay for everything he's done.

87
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:43,180
Duelists, take your places.

88
00:05:44,420 --> 00:05:46,340
The final battle is here,

89
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:50,260
and the fate of mankind rests
on your shoulders, my pharaoh.

90
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:54,220
The evil that now controls
my brother must be expelled,

91
00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:57,480
and you are the only one
capable of this task.

92
00:05:57,640 --> 00:06:01,480
If he prevails, the world
as we know it will perish.

93
00:06:02,940 --> 00:06:05,040
I will defeat you, Merrick.

94
00:06:05,460 --> 00:06:07,440
I'd like to see you try.

95
00:06:08,860 --> 00:06:10,060
Commence dueling!

96
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:17,700
Let the fun begin, now!

97
00:06:20,740 --> 00:06:22,800
I should have seen this coming.

98
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:25,560
Oh no, it's another Shadow Game.

99
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:27,640
Hang in there, Yook.

100
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:34,400
Now then, you've witnessed
several of my Shadow Games before,

101
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:36,437
but this one will be different.

102
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:40,180
I've thrown in a few
twists, especially for you.

103
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,140
Hang in there, Mai.

104
00:06:50,980 --> 00:06:52,120
This is it.

105
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:54,760
Our last chance to stop Marek.

106
00:06:56,540 --> 00:07:01,660
Now, Pharaoh, it's time to reveal
the first of my surprises for you.

107
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:03,640
What's going on?

108
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,340
Please, help!

109
00:07:07,220 --> 00:07:09,680
See someone familiar, do we?

110
00:07:09,980 --> 00:07:14,000
It's your dear friend, Mai,
slowly slipping into the shadows.

111
00:07:14,380 --> 00:07:17,200
Once our duel ends, she'll be gone.

112
00:07:18,140 --> 00:07:21,420
No, I won't let this
madness continue, Merrick.

113
00:07:24,100 --> 00:07:26,140
I'm afraid it gets worse.

114
00:07:26,460 --> 00:07:30,020
She's not the only one who's
in danger here. Why's that?

115
00:07:30,340 --> 00:07:36,420
Just as I said, I have several surprises
in store for you today. Are you ready?

116
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:39,080
Meet my next victim.

117
00:07:44,380 --> 00:07:45,400
Oh, no!

118
00:07:46,140 --> 00:07:47,860
What? Yugi!

119
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:54,060
Do you understand what's at stake now?

120
00:07:54,380 --> 00:07:57,960
Lose the duel and Yugi
goes to the Shadow Realm!

121
00:07:58,500 --> 00:08:01,676
Merrick, this is about you
and me, so leave him alone!

122
00:08:01,760 --> 00:08:02,720
That's not true!

123
00:08:03,100 --> 00:08:05,100
You're forgetting my weaker half!

124
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:09,200
He's involved in this conflict as well!

125
00:08:09,460 --> 00:08:12,620
So if I lose, the Shadows will take him!

126
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:14,180
No, you can't!

127
00:08:14,380 --> 00:08:15,720
I just did.

128
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:20,100
The Shadow Realm will claim an
innocent soul no matter who wins.

129
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:21,760
And now let's duel.

130
00:08:22,140 --> 00:08:24,260
I summon Vampiric Leech.

131
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,960
Attack him directly.

132
00:08:32,460 --> 00:08:36,860
You've probably figured this out,
but my Leech can attack instantly.

133
00:08:42,460 --> 00:08:46,060
You just lost 500 of
your life points, Mero.

134
00:08:46,380 --> 00:08:47,700
But that's not all.

135
00:08:49,540 --> 00:08:50,370
Yugi!

136
00:08:51,180 --> 00:08:53,080
What have you done, Merrick?

137
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:58,560
When you lose life points, your friend will
lose a piece of himself to the darkness.

138
00:09:00,980 --> 00:09:02,100
That's madness.

139
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:03,540
That's ingenious.

140
00:09:03,780 --> 00:09:07,920
Now, when your life points reach
zero, not only will I win the duel,

141
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:10,104
but Yu-Gi will be gone forever!

142
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:13,520
And the same rule applies
to my former self!

143
00:09:13,740 --> 00:09:14,740
I won't duel!

144
00:09:15,060 --> 00:09:16,460
You have to!

145
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:17,920
He's right, Pharaoh!

146
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:19,780
You must duel!

147
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:23,460
I'm in control of this shadow game! There!

148
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,160
We're in my world!

149
00:09:25,620 --> 00:09:30,100
Remember, I can banish Yu-Gi to
the Shadow Realm anytime I wish!

150
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:32,202
You'll pay for what you've done!

151
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:33,420
I disagree!

152
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,597
It is you who shall pay!

153
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:40,980
He may not realize this, but when
Yugi's body is consumed by the darkness,

154
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:45,280
the Pharaoh will cease to exist
in this world For without a body,

155
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:47,699
he's nothing but a wandering spirit

156
00:09:50,060 --> 00:09:51,860
We can do this!

157
00:09:52,540 --> 00:09:56,980
Ever since you and I first met, we
faced everything together as a team!

158
00:09:57,340 --> 00:09:59,560
This Shadow Game is no different!

159
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:05,420
You're right I'm still right here next
to you, and we can defeat Eric together!

160
00:10:05,680 --> 00:10:07,140
He'll never win this!

161
00:10:07,420 --> 00:10:11,000
Yes, the future of so many
depends upon our victory.

162
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:12,713
We can't let them down.

163
00:10:12,900 --> 00:10:15,860
This is the most important
duel we've ever fought.

164
00:10:16,220 --> 00:10:17,577
If Merrick were to prevail,

165
00:10:17,660 --> 00:10:23,140
he would gain all three Egyptian god cards,
along with the key to infinite power.

166
00:10:23,500 --> 00:10:27,380
And four innocent souls would
be forever lost in the darkness.

167
00:10:27,860 --> 00:10:30,477
I'm now certain the reason Yugi and I were

168
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:34,160
brought together was so we
could win this one duel.

169
00:10:36,340 --> 00:10:37,397
Ha, ha, ha, ha.

170
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:39,460
Failure is not an option.

171
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:46,560
That jerk.

172
00:10:46,900 --> 00:10:49,429
Only Marek could think
of a game this sick.

173
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:50,560
Poor Yugi.

174
00:10:50,820 --> 00:10:52,880
If he loses, he'll be gone forever.

175
00:10:53,300 --> 00:10:54,960
You can beat this guy, pal.

176
00:10:55,660 --> 00:10:56,580
Ha, ha, ha, ha.

177
00:10:56,980 --> 00:10:59,380
Now then, it's still my turn.

178
00:10:59,660 --> 00:11:03,360
So I shall activate another of
my leech's special abilities

179
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:08,460
By discarding one card, I can switch
my leech back into defense mode.

180
00:11:08,740 --> 00:11:12,477
Then why don't you choose a card
to dispose of so we can move on?

181
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:13,390
Not to worry!

182
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:17,640
I already know exactly what card
I'm sending to the graveyard!

183
00:11:19,780 --> 00:11:22,180
My plan is working perfectly!

184
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:25,581
Now that my Egyptian God
card is in the graveyard,

185
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:31,500
I can easily summon it back to the field
thanks to my Monster Reborn Magic card!

186
00:11:32,140 --> 00:11:33,340
Hold on, Pharaoh.

187
00:11:33,640 --> 00:11:34,940
I'm not quite done.

188
00:11:35,380 --> 00:11:37,220
My leech moves to defense mode.

189
00:11:37,700 --> 00:11:40,300
And finally, I'll place
one card face down.

190
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:41,670
Now go!

191
00:11:42,020 --> 00:11:45,100
I know exactly what Maric's strategy is.

192
00:11:45,300 --> 00:11:48,317
He transferred his winged
dragon of Ra to the graveyard.

193
00:11:48,400 --> 00:11:53,440
Then he'll use Monster Reborn to bring
it back, just like he did last time.

194
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:54,600
It's my move!

195
00:11:55,940 --> 00:11:56,900
All right.

196
00:11:58,860 --> 00:12:01,760
I play my queen's knight in attack mode.

197
00:12:06,400 --> 00:12:11,660
He'll try to summon three monsters to
sacrifice for his Egyptian god card.

198
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:14,200
Now attack his leech, my queen.

199
00:12:19,420 --> 00:12:20,960
Unfortunately for you,

200
00:12:21,180 --> 00:12:25,297
my vampiric leech was in defense
mode, so I don't lose points.

201
00:12:25,380 --> 00:12:27,740
I'll play two cards face down.

202
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:29,520
That ends my turn.

203
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:31,100
Very well.

204
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:33,860
Then I'll continue my onslaught.

205
00:12:36,700 --> 00:12:39,057
I have a feeling Marek's gonna summon his

206
00:12:39,140 --> 00:12:42,022
Egyptian god card the same
way he did in my duel.

207
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:47,420
I've drawn just what I need.

208
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:51,377
But before I use it, I have
one more thing to take care of.

209
00:12:51,460 --> 00:12:55,320
so I summon my Joragato in a turnbow!

210
00:12:58,440 --> 00:13:01,940
Now, my beast, destroy his queen's knight!

211
00:13:09,220 --> 00:13:10,540
Are you all right?

212
00:13:12,460 --> 00:13:14,197
I'll be fine, just win this duel!

213
00:13:14,280 --> 00:13:16,620
Next I'll place two cards face down.

214
00:13:16,860 --> 00:13:18,160
Now it's your move!

215
00:13:18,400 --> 00:13:19,940
All right, here goes!

216
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:26,700
Activate trap card, left-arm offering!

217
00:13:27,540 --> 00:13:32,740
Yes, this card lets me move one
magic card from my deck to my hand.

218
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:38,260
Once I've discarded every card I'm
holding, so I'll take the one card I need.

219
00:13:38,560 --> 00:13:40,260
My monster reborn!

220
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:41,780
You're through!

221
00:13:42,040 --> 00:13:43,620
I'm afraid you're wrong!

222
00:13:43,900 --> 00:13:44,960
Reveal exchange!

223
00:13:45,980 --> 00:13:49,880
This allows each of us to draw
a card from the other's hand.

224
00:13:50,780 --> 00:13:51,680
Choose a card.

225
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:55,800
And hand over your Monster Reborn now.

226
00:13:56,740 --> 00:13:57,720
All right.

227
00:13:57,980 --> 00:13:59,240
Nice move, Hugh.

228
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:01,600
Take it. With pleasure.

229
00:14:06,980 --> 00:14:08,120
Too bad.

230
00:14:08,700 --> 00:14:11,700
Now Merrick can't bring
back his Egyptian God card.

231
00:14:13,680 --> 00:14:17,280
Little does he know I have
another way to summon Ra.

232
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:22,240
I'll use Monster Reborn to
bring back Queen's Knight!

233
00:14:22,520 --> 00:14:24,932
And then I shall summon my King's Knight!

234
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:33,220
When King's and Queen's
Knight are in play,

235
00:14:33,460 --> 00:14:36,460
their special ability
allows me to summon this!

236
00:14:36,800 --> 00:14:37,800
Jack's Knight!

237
00:14:41,540 --> 00:14:47,240
Now I have three monsters on my side of
the field, Merrick, and you have only one.

238
00:14:47,940 --> 00:14:49,480
I'm not impressed.

239
00:14:51,660 --> 00:14:56,760
You're planning to sacrifice all three of
your monsters so you can summon Slifer.

240
00:14:56,980 --> 00:14:59,680
And when you do, I'll be ready.

241
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:01,120
Come on.

242
00:15:01,340 --> 00:15:02,720
He's bluffing, dude.

243
00:15:02,980 --> 00:15:04,060
Attack this freak.

244
00:15:04,380 --> 00:15:06,637
Yeah, Merrick's right where you want him.

245
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:09,880
It's time to rock his
world now. Hold on, guys.

246
00:15:10,380 --> 00:15:12,640
Merrick still has two cards face down.

247
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:14,217
Yugi's got to be careful.

248
00:15:14,300 --> 00:15:16,300
You've just said it yourself.

249
00:15:16,660 --> 00:15:18,940
Your monsters outnumber mine.

250
00:15:20,460 --> 00:15:22,300
What are you waiting for?

251
00:15:22,580 --> 00:15:23,460
Attack me!

252
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:27,400
Once he attacks, I'll
unleash my secret weapon.

253
00:15:28,640 --> 00:15:33,700
Well, has the mighty pharaoh realized
that there's no way he can prevail?

254
00:15:38,980 --> 00:15:41,917
It looks like the pharaoh
is afraid to attack.

255
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:44,300
I end my turn.

256
00:15:44,580 --> 00:15:46,440
What's the deal? That's it?

257
00:15:46,780 --> 00:15:50,957
Yugi could have done some serious damage
if he attacked with one of his knights.

258
00:15:51,040 --> 00:15:52,440
Don't be so sure.

259
00:15:52,820 --> 00:15:56,877
I think he did the right thing by
chilling out and waiting to attack, guys.

260
00:15:56,960 --> 00:15:57,820
I agree.

261
00:15:58,240 --> 00:16:01,711
He's got great instincts and
he knew the time wasn't right.

262
00:16:01,880 --> 00:16:02,860
I'd do that too.

263
00:16:03,380 --> 00:16:06,145
Marek's definitely got
something up his sleeve.

264
00:16:08,100 --> 00:16:08,957
My move.

265
00:16:09,040 --> 00:16:11,620
I'll place one more card face down.

266
00:16:12,880 --> 00:16:13,940
All right,

267
00:16:14,280 --> 00:16:16,560
now I could end this shortly,

268
00:16:16,860 --> 00:16:22,620
although it would be much more amusing to
extend this game and prolong your summary.

269
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:28,080
Since you're going to lose this duel
when I play my Egyptian God card,

270
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:33,040
I've decided to offer you some assistance,
Pharaoh, so you can play yours.

271
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:39,040
Therefore, I shall play this
magic card, Card of Sanctity.

272
00:16:39,580 --> 00:16:44,720
So we must each draw from our deck until
we're holding six cards in our hand.

273
00:16:44,980 --> 00:16:46,640
Just consider that a gift.

274
00:16:47,880 --> 00:16:51,800
Now, select your cards and best of luck.

275
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:53,660
Who knows what you'll draw?

276
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:56,948
I'm afraid you're about
to regret that move.

277
00:16:58,940 --> 00:17:02,000
Have you drawn your Egyptian God card?

278
00:17:02,260 --> 00:17:04,180
Or do you need more help?

279
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:06,497
I suppose I'll find out soon.

280
00:17:06,580 --> 00:17:11,020
I'll switch Jurogedo to
defense mode and end my turn!

281
00:17:11,420 --> 00:17:13,480
All right, Merrick, my move!

282
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:15,960
Go ahead, Barrow!

283
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:19,220
Summon your Egyptian god card, if you can!

284
00:17:19,560 --> 00:17:22,080
Let's see what the Great Sniper can do!

285
00:17:22,500 --> 00:17:24,680
I sacrifice my Jax Knight,

286
00:17:24,940 --> 00:17:30,900
my Queen's Knight, and my King's Knight
in order to summon Sniper, the Sky Dragon!

287
00:17:32,060 --> 00:17:35,360
Reveal yourself, my all-powerful beast!

288
00:17:46,660 --> 00:17:49,780
Just as I thought, the war begins! Yeah!

289
00:17:50,620 --> 00:17:51,760
Way to go, Yug!

290
00:17:52,040 --> 00:17:53,720
Slip has got your back now!

291
00:17:54,020 --> 00:17:56,700
And with 6,000 attack points, you're set!

292
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:58,560
Marix moved back by it!

293
00:17:58,920 --> 00:18:01,449
No matter what he does,
Dad Freak is toast!

294
00:18:01,580 --> 00:18:03,756
So attack him and win this duel, pal!

295
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:05,760
Could this be the end?

296
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:13,320
Behold the power of Slifer
and its thunder force attack!

297
00:18:15,840 --> 00:18:17,700
Your monster's nothing!

298
00:18:18,080 --> 00:18:19,640
I have this!

299
00:18:19,900 --> 00:18:23,440
Reveal magic card, Dark
Spell Regeneration!

300
00:18:24,700 --> 00:18:26,880
Hey, Seto, what's that?

301
00:18:27,100 --> 00:18:29,460
It's a rare card. With it,

302
00:18:29,620 --> 00:18:31,697
Merrick can move any magic card he wants

303
00:18:31,780 --> 00:18:34,486
from the card graveyard
back to the field now.

304
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:36,460
Anyone he wants?

305
00:18:36,580 --> 00:18:39,040
Yes, and we both know what that means.

306
00:18:39,380 --> 00:18:43,360
And now, I'll choose to play
Monster Reborn, Pharaoh,

307
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:47,660
which allows me to revive my
mighty winged dragon of raw.

308
00:18:49,460 --> 00:18:53,760
Now, my dragon, emerge in
your unstoppable phoenix mode.

309
00:19:05,840 --> 00:19:11,480
My Egyptian god has neutralized
the power of yours In this mode,

310
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:16,900
rise immortal for one whole turn
So nothing you do can stop it

311
00:19:18,760 --> 00:19:21,820
That thing is nuts And I ought to know,

312
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:25,640
it knocked me out cold Thanks
to the fiery wrath of Ra,

313
00:19:26,060 --> 00:19:31,660
little Yugi will soon be consumed by
darkness and absolute power will be mine!
